1
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:29,199
Anda, you must find this person.

2
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:34,759
What is that girl doing?

3
00:02:34,759 --> 00:02:35,680
Screaming so loudly.

4
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:36,800
Let's go.

5
00:02:45,479 --> 00:02:46,000
Dad.

6
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:48,120
Xiaobei originally said he'd stay home

7
00:02:48,599 --> 00:02:49,919
and cook a whole meal himself.

8
00:02:50,159 --> 00:02:51,080
I was actually quite touched.

9
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,400
Then out of nowhere,

10
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,439
he switched to a restaurant.

11
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:58,879
His bad habit of standing people up...

12
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,960
seems to come from certain senior leaders

13
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:01,680
and old-timers.

14
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:05,159
You've got something to say, don't you?

15
00:03:06,159 --> 00:03:07,240
Who stood anyone up?

16
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:08,879
Exactly, Dad.

17
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,479
In what he just said,

18
00:03:10,479 --> 00:03:12,159
he's completely dissatisfied with you.

19
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,479
Not dissatisfied.

20
00:03:13,479 --> 00:03:14,560
It's outright slander.

21
00:03:14,919 --> 00:03:16,240
How would I dare slander you?

22
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:18,639
I'm just saying Xiaobei is unreliable.

23
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:19,400
Right?

24
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,280
I mean, his unreliability

25
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,439
might be inherited from the family traditions

26
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:25,439
of certain old-timers and senior leaders—

27
00:03:25,719 --> 00:03:26,719
never keeping their word.

28
00:03:27,199 --> 00:03:28,439
Still, he shouldn't be like that.

29
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,319
Like what?

30
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:35,840
Well, take this for example.

31
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:38,520
Certain senior leaders and old-timers

32
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,560
have been saying for years

33
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,120
they'd make us Xiang-style noodles,

34
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:42,680
yet we still haven't had any.

35
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,400
You've never had them?

36
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:47,159
The last time I ate your noodles,

37
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:49,840
I had just lost my baby teeth.

38
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:56,560
Was it that long ago?

39
00:03:56,919 --> 00:03:58,159
Of course it was!

40
00:03:59,159 --> 00:04:00,719
Xiaobei wasn't even born yet back then.

41
00:04:06,599 --> 00:04:07,039
Fine.

42
00:04:07,919 --> 00:04:08,639
Let me tell you,

43
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:11,719
if you want to eat my Xiang-style noodles,

44
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:14,439
what little you've achieved so far

45
00:04:15,039 --> 00:04:15,960
doesn't make the cut.

46
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:18,639
He never grows up, no matter how old he gets.

47
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:19,519
Come on, Dad.

48
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,240
A toast to you.

49
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,480
May you stay forever young.

50
00:04:23,879 --> 00:04:24,480
Good.

51
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:25,360
Dad,

52
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:27,000
I wish for myself

53
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:29,120
that I'll get to eat your noodles soon.

54
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,800
Cut that out.

55
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,439
All right, cheers.

56
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,519
Work hard,

57
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,040
and when you go to Antilocaris,

58
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:40,680
I wish you both great success.

59
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:42,319
Thanks, Dad.

60
00:04:47,759 --> 00:04:49,160
Sha Lan, you're so lucky.

61
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,439
Every year on your birthday,

62
00:04:50,439 --> 00:04:51,879
Wei Tian gives you a doll.

63
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:55,160
Don't you think

64
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,839
the quality of the dolls Wei Tian gives me

65
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:58,120
gets worse with each passing year?

66
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:01,959
Well, at least you remember your own birthday.

67
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:05,160
Come on, just count your blessings.

68
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:09,079
Wei Tian, today is Sha Lan's birthday.

69
00:05:09,079 --> 00:05:09,959
Let's open a bottle of wine.

70
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:12,800
Sure.

71
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:55,759
Y-You... Are you all right?

72
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:57,920
I-I'll call the police.

73
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,879
No need. I know who did it.

74
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:05,199
It was my cook and waitress.

75
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,160
They took my money and eloped.

76
00:06:08,079 --> 00:06:08,839
But it's fine.

77
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,160
I'm used to it.

78
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,399
Good thing you showed up

79
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:13,519
and saved my life.

80
00:06:14,319 --> 00:06:14,800
Thank you.

81
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,240
Could you help me—

82
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:21,279
You're the owner of this bar?

83
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,240
That would be me.

84
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:27,759
Of all the bars in this town,

85
00:06:28,639 --> 00:06:30,360
you happened to walk into mine.

86
00:06:31,079 --> 00:06:33,680
Don't you think it's fate?

87
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,879
I saw online

88
00:06:36,879 --> 00:06:39,240
that this bar's owner is Chinese,

89
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:39,920
so I came over.

90
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,120
I want to ask about someone.

91
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:43,639
Who?

92
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:46,839
A Chinese man.

93
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:50,160
He's incredible at fighting and shooting.

94
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,920
In dangerous situations,

95
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:58,000
he doesn't flinch.

96
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,319
He looks cold and detached,

97
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:03,160
like he has a total poker face.

98
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,360
Do you know who he is?

99
00:07:04,639 --> 00:07:06,720
You must mean the Silent Protectors.

100
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:09,040
The Silent Protectors?

101
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:09,519
Yeah.

102
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:12,160
That's what everyone in this city calls them.

103
00:07:12,879 --> 00:07:14,279
They're the hunters of this city,

104
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,600
guarding it.

105
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,000
However,

106
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,199
only when you're in danger

107
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,800
will they show up

108
00:07:20,319 --> 00:07:21,240
to handle your trouble.

109
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:25,000
"They"? So there are others?

110
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,560
Yeah, more than one.

111
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:29,240
Among them is a sniper

112
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,720
who never misses a shot,

113
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,800
a skilled hacker,

114
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,319
and a legendary,

115
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,360
stunningly gorgeous hunter.

116
00:07:36,839 --> 00:07:38,720
The one you mentioned is the most mysterious.

117
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:41,519
Hardly anyone has seen his real face.

118
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,439
Someone missing you?

119
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,040
Who's missing me?

120
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,800
Talking smack about me. Let's go.

121
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,079
Take your meds and get back to work.

122
00:07:55,319 --> 00:07:56,439
No matter how mysterious they are,

123
00:07:56,439 --> 00:07:58,399
they can still be found, right?

124
00:07:58,399 --> 00:08:00,839
So, can you help me look for them?

125
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:03,199
A lot of people come and go here.

126
00:08:03,399 --> 00:08:04,279
I'll ask around for you.

127
00:08:04,639 --> 00:08:06,519
Drop by often if you're free.

128
00:08:06,519 --> 00:08:08,319
Maybe right here

129
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:09,639
you'll hear news about them.

130
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:13,680
They have a motto online:

131
00:08:14,399 --> 00:08:16,000
"Anytime, anywhere.

132
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:19,040
Regardless of race or nationality.

133
00:08:19,439 --> 00:08:20,279
Only for you."

134
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,319
About the report you sent headquarters...

135
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,800
They've already reviewed it,

136
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:31,680
but every one of them refused

137
00:08:31,839 --> 00:08:33,159
to approve the security budget.

138
00:08:33,799 --> 00:08:34,679
My hands are tied.

139
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:37,440
So all we can do is hope

140
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,639
that when we go out from now on,

141
00:08:39,639 --> 00:08:41,440
we stay safe and steer clear of danger.

142
00:08:45,559 --> 00:08:48,159
Mr. Xiao, can't you ask headquarters

143
00:08:48,159 --> 00:08:49,559
to buy me a bulletproof vest?

144
00:08:49,879 --> 00:08:51,080
A bulletproof vest?

145
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:54,080
Anda, where do you think this is?

146
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:54,720
A battlefield?

147
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,200
Why would you need body armor?

148
00:08:57,759 --> 00:08:58,679
Let me tell you,

149
00:08:58,679 --> 00:09:00,480
stop worrying over nothing all day.

150
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,279
Focus all your mind

151
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:02,759
on your work.

152
00:09:02,759 --> 00:09:03,399
Got it?

153
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,399
Mr. Douglas,

154
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,960
my politician friend in Aralia told me

155
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,919
that an unidentified man

156
00:09:36,159 --> 00:09:37,399
has arrived in Antilocaris.

157
00:09:37,919 --> 00:09:38,919
He's a politician

158
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:41,879
who wants to run in Aralia's election in six months.

159
00:09:41,879 --> 00:09:44,200
Clearly, he's an obstacle to me and my friend.

160
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:46,600
Do you need me to eliminate him?

161
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,919
No, we don't like killing.

162
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:50,960
But you must find him

163
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:53,360
and get the bank investment plan from him.

164
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,279
We're going to legitimately

165
00:09:55,279 --> 00:09:56,559
strip him of his election leverage.

166
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,720
Political bank investments these days

167
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,960
are kept strictly confidential.

168
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,039
Besides, with information so accessible,

169
00:10:02,559 --> 00:10:05,399
who would keep an investment plan

170
00:10:05,799 --> 00:10:06,960
right on their person?

171
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,519
He's just that kind of man.

172
00:10:10,399 --> 00:10:12,320
And right now, across all channels,

173
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:14,000
no one can identify the bank backing him.

174
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:17,679
Understood.

175
00:10:18,519 --> 00:10:19,600
If it's not on him,

176
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:22,399
then the plan can only be

177
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,279
with General Walter.

178
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,240
Leave it to me.

179
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:29,960
Sir!

180
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:30,320
Hello.

181
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,799
I have fresh avocados here.

182
00:10:31,799 --> 00:10:32,879
Want to take one?

183
00:10:33,159 --> 00:10:33,639
Are they good?

184
00:10:33,759 --> 00:10:34,440
Of course.

185
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:38,039
I'll take this one, then.

186
00:10:47,159 --> 00:10:47,720
Stop!

187
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:49,559
Thief!

188
00:10:50,919 --> 00:10:51,559
Stop!

189
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:54,519
Catch the thief!

190
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:58,639
Stop!

191
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,360
Stop!

192
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,039
Here you go.

193
00:11:29,519 --> 00:11:30,159
Your wallet.

194
00:11:30,519 --> 00:11:31,720
Thank you so much.

195
00:11:32,399 --> 00:11:32,919
You're welcome.

196
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:34,399
There are a lot of pickpockets around here.

197
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:35,440
Be careful in the future.

198
00:11:35,519 --> 00:11:36,759
What should I call you?

199
00:11:37,519 --> 00:11:38,159
Just call me Helen.

200
00:11:38,559 --> 00:11:39,279
Helen.

201
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:57,960
Shen Yu.

202
00:11:59,799 --> 00:12:00,360
Helen.

203
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:02,840
Long time no see.

204
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,240
Yeah. What brings you here?

205
00:12:04,759 --> 00:12:06,399
Mr. Xiang said it was an urgent mission.

206
00:12:06,639 --> 00:12:08,440
I wrapped up another mission in Libania

207
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:09,440
and rushed right over.

208
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:10,279
Take a seat first.

209
00:12:10,679 --> 00:12:11,360
Where's Xiang Lai?

210
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:12,679
He's focusing hard on training.

211
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:15,039
The client should be here any minute.

212
00:12:15,879 --> 00:12:17,559
Just outside Zhong'an's entrance earlier,

213
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:18,240
I ran into a thief.

214
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:19,000
For real?

215
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:19,759
Really.

216
00:12:21,519 --> 00:12:22,399
This way, please, sir.

217
00:12:25,039 --> 00:12:25,919
Hello, Mr. Shen Yu.

218
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:26,840
Daniel.

219
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,320
Sorry, I'm a few minutes late.

220
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:30,480
No problem. This is our...

221
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:31,320
We meet again.

222
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:32,720
We meet again.

223
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:33,960
You know each other?

224
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:35,039
Just now, nearby,

225
00:12:35,039 --> 00:12:36,399
a thief snatched my wallet.

226
00:12:36,399 --> 00:12:37,960
Luckily, this lady stepped in

227
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:38,919
and retrieved it for me.

228
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,000
Let's sit down and talk.

229
00:12:41,279 --> 00:12:41,639
Sure.

230
00:12:44,639 --> 00:12:45,039
Daniel.

231
00:12:45,759 --> 00:12:47,000
Regarding this assignment,

232
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,399
we understand the basic situation,

233
00:12:49,039 --> 00:12:50,080
but we still have a question.

234
00:12:52,679 --> 00:12:53,759
I've reviewed the briefing.

235
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:56,320
As for the VIP we're tasked to protect,

236
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:57,120
Mr. Xavier...

237
00:12:57,679 --> 00:12:59,519
you might hire others to protect him too,

238
00:12:59,519 --> 00:13:00,159
right?

239
00:13:00,159 --> 00:13:01,000
Naturally.

240
00:13:01,639 --> 00:13:02,519
If that's the case,

241
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:04,200
why come to Zhong'an?

242
00:13:05,279 --> 00:13:07,000
We're very reluctant to work

243
00:13:07,240 --> 00:13:09,080
with strangers on protection missions.

244
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:11,000
After all, without training together,

245
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,360
there's no coordination or chemistry.

246
00:13:12,879 --> 00:13:14,960
You'll understand once you see Xavier at the hospital.

247
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,960
We know doing this

248
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:18,000
puts you in a difficult position,

249
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:20,320
but there's no better option.

250
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:22,919
So please bear with our request.

251
00:13:25,399 --> 00:13:26,600
And what if we refuse?

252
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,879
If you insist on turning it down,

253
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:31,039
we certainly won't force the matter.

254
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:33,279
However, from now on, for Zhong'an Group,

255
00:13:33,279 --> 00:13:34,360
as a foreign company,

256
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:35,840
operating in Antilocaris,

257
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:37,919
or across the Kingdom of Supedo,

258
00:13:37,919 --> 00:13:39,559
things might not be as smooth as they are now.

259
00:13:40,799 --> 00:13:41,960
You're threatening us.

260
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:47,039
This job is too rushed.

261
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,840
We have zero intel on what's going on.

262
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:52,840
So I suggest we don't take it.

263
00:13:53,799 --> 00:13:54,679
Why not take it?

264
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:57,200
They already gave us a check for the retainer,

265
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:58,639
and look at all those zeros.

266
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:00,639
I can practically smell the money.

267
00:14:00,799 --> 00:14:02,039
You're obsessed with money.

268
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:04,080
It also comes with extra danger.

269
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,799
Did surveillance catch anything?

270
00:14:08,120 --> 00:14:09,480
Didn't catch his face. Look.

271
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,519
Wrapped up so tightly,

272
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,240
he probably doesn't want anyone

273
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,240
to find out his identity.

274
00:14:18,159 --> 00:14:19,639
We don't even know

275
00:14:19,639 --> 00:14:20,799
who the client is,

276
00:14:21,799 --> 00:14:23,200
so how can we take this job?

277
00:14:24,679 --> 00:14:27,080
What kind of person do you think he is?

278
00:14:27,799 --> 00:14:29,279
Giving us so much money,

279
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:30,320
yet refusing to show his face.

280
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:33,120
"Mr. W" in the contract...

281
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,279
Hearing you say that,

282
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:35,759
I can guess a thing or two.

283
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,360
If you have that kind of privilege,

284
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,559
why not contact the police directly,

285
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:42,559
instead of a foreign company like ours?

286
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:44,840
You're a sharp one indeed.

287
00:14:45,679 --> 00:14:48,240
Mr. Xavier's status is rather sensitive.

288
00:14:49,039 --> 00:14:51,240
It's not convenient to use official channels

289
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,279
to provide protection for him.

290
00:14:52,879 --> 00:14:53,679
In other words,

291
00:14:54,159 --> 00:14:55,879
even if we mobilize the local police

292
00:14:55,879 --> 00:14:56,799
or security forces,

293
00:14:57,399 --> 00:14:59,480
it would only tip off the enemy

294
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,759
and invite danger upon him.

295
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:02,279
As you know,

296
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:04,440
although the security in Antilocaris

297
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:06,720
is somewhat complicated,

298
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,000
inside a hospital,

299
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,200
an attack on a high-profile figure

300
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:09,919
has never happened before.

301
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,440
Since Zhong'an Group

302
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:12,679
wants to gain a foothold here,

303
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,240
with your capabilities,

304
00:15:14,519 --> 00:15:15,879
protecting a single person

305
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:17,159
shouldn't be a problem.

306
00:15:19,039 --> 00:15:19,879
Time is tight.

307
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:21,039
I won't stay here

308
00:15:21,039 --> 00:15:22,960
and delay your protection planning.

309
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:25,039
One-third of the fee

310
00:15:25,039 --> 00:15:25,799
will be wired within half an hour

311
00:15:25,799 --> 00:15:26,960
to your bank account.

312
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:28,080
The remaining balance

313
00:15:28,399 --> 00:15:30,960
will be paid right after Xavier

314
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:31,559
safely leaves the hospital.

315
00:15:35,399 --> 00:15:38,879
Hoping Zhong'an will accept our mission.

316
00:15:41,399 --> 00:15:43,000
From what I see, this guy named Xavier

317
00:15:43,399 --> 00:15:45,200
isn't as simple as the request suggests.

318
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:48,240
I think he's more than just a businessman.

319
00:15:48,679 --> 00:15:52,240
Right. No normal person would do this:

320
00:15:52,879 --> 00:15:53,879
leaving his own country

321
00:15:54,279 --> 00:15:55,279
to go somewhere else

322
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:56,679
for heart surgery,

323
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:59,039
and keeping it so secretive.

324
00:15:59,639 --> 00:16:00,679
He doesn't want his moves

325
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:02,240
leaked to anyone at all.

326
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:04,159
So,

327
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:06,080
we're probably his only choice.

328
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:06,679
Right.

329
00:16:09,919 --> 00:16:11,279
I still think it's dangerous.

330
00:16:11,639 --> 00:16:12,120
Take it.

331
00:16:12,879 --> 00:16:14,559
We'll investigate as we go.

332
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:15,480
All right.

333
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:17,360
Here's the plan.

334
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:21,399
Captain and Sha Lan will gather intel.

335
00:16:22,279 --> 00:16:23,120
I'll head to the hotel myself.

336
00:16:23,639 --> 00:16:24,120
You stay on standby.

337
00:16:24,519 --> 00:16:25,679
I'll contact you if anything comes up.

338
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:26,480
Okay.

339
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:28,799
Time to get to work!

340
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:32,440
Since when did you get so money-hungry?

341
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:53,639
It's about time.

342
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:57,080
Let's move.

343
00:18:32,759 --> 00:18:33,440
What's the rush?

344
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:37,319
There's still time.

345
00:18:38,759 --> 00:18:40,200
Why can't you keep your cool?

346
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:41,200
Understood.

347
00:18:42,759 --> 00:18:46,160
The surgery takes at least two hours.

348
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:48,240
We just need to get there before then.

349
00:19:50,839 --> 00:19:51,359
Hello.

350
00:19:51,839 --> 00:19:53,799
I'm Helen, captain of the Zhong'an Special Ops Team.

351
00:19:54,119 --> 00:19:55,480
Mr. Xiang sent me to work with you.

352
00:19:58,839 --> 00:20:00,480
Hello, I'm Wei Tian.

353
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:06,119
Come on.

354
00:20:07,319 --> 00:20:08,960
Another team is here to protect you.

355
00:20:10,599 --> 00:20:12,319
Hello, I'm Helen from Zhong'an.

356
00:20:12,519 --> 00:20:13,559
Nice to meet you.

357
00:20:13,559 --> 00:20:14,839
This is your attending physician,

358
00:20:14,839 --> 00:20:15,559
Dr. Avril.

359
00:20:15,559 --> 00:20:16,559
Pleased to meet you.

360
00:20:16,559 --> 00:20:16,960
Hello.

361
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,079
It's not safe out here.

362
00:20:18,079 --> 00:20:18,839
Let's head inside first.

363
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:19,799
Follow me.

364
00:20:20,200 --> 00:20:20,599
All right.

365
00:20:58,319 --> 00:21:01,279
Security officers. A man and a woman.

366
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:05,480
This way, please.

367
00:21:16,559 --> 00:21:19,839
Security officers—one man, one woman.

368
00:21:21,839 --> 00:21:23,000
He only hired two people.

369
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:26,240
Only two people are watching over him.

370
00:21:26,519 --> 00:21:28,480
Looks like it'll be much easier than expected.

371
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:30,319
Takes the fun out of it.

372
00:21:32,279 --> 00:21:33,200
What time is it now?

373
00:21:35,200 --> 00:21:36,759
It's 12:50.

374
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:41,039
The surgery is supposed to start at two, right?

375
00:21:41,519 --> 00:21:42,000
Yes.

376
00:21:42,319 --> 00:21:44,640
Do you have any questions about the surgery?

377
00:21:44,839 --> 00:21:45,599
No, no, no.

378
00:21:45,599 --> 00:21:47,240
We've already discussed everything clearly.

379
00:21:48,119 --> 00:21:49,359
Why just sit here waiting?

380
00:21:49,359 --> 00:21:50,880
Is it possible to start right now?

381
00:21:51,480 --> 00:21:52,720
I just wanted to...

382
00:21:53,559 --> 00:21:55,720
get it started and over with sooner, that's all.

383
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:58,079
All right. Go get a gurney ready.

384
00:21:58,079 --> 00:21:59,680
No, I can walk on my own.

385
00:22:01,240 --> 00:22:02,119
Head over first, then.

386
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:02,839
Okay.

387
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:04,039
I'll get ready and be right there.

388
00:22:04,039 --> 00:22:04,559
Thank you.

389
00:22:14,599 --> 00:22:15,559
Is this the hospital control room

390
00:22:15,559 --> 00:22:16,640
you mentioned earlier?

391
00:22:16,759 --> 00:22:17,359
Yes.

392
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:18,720
Okay.

393
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:41,079
We're starting the surgery now.

394
00:22:43,440 --> 00:22:45,480
Mr. Xavier, please relax.

395
00:22:45,799 --> 00:22:47,039
Administering anesthesia now.

396
00:23:05,319 --> 00:23:06,720
This is for the hospital PA system.

397
00:23:07,079 --> 00:23:07,640
Yes.

398
00:23:08,759 --> 00:23:09,599
And...

399
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:10,880
this phone...

400
00:23:10,880 --> 00:23:12,440
is for calling the OR?

401
00:23:12,799 --> 00:23:13,240
Yes.

402
00:23:13,519 --> 00:23:14,880
Okay, got it.

403
00:23:15,599 --> 00:23:17,680
Alright. Starting now,

404
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:19,440
I'm Derek, the hospital's head nurse.

405
00:23:19,599 --> 00:23:20,079
Okay.

406
00:23:20,519 --> 00:23:21,680
No matter what happens,

407
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:22,559
don't intervene.

408
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:24,000
All you're responsible for is

409
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:25,119
making sure the surgery goes smoothly.

410
00:23:25,720 --> 00:23:26,640
Leave the rest to me.

411
00:23:27,119 --> 00:23:27,720
No problem.

412
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:42,960
Have you confirmed the number of security guards?

413
00:23:43,240 --> 00:23:44,640
We'll be there shortly.

414
00:23:46,160 --> 00:23:48,200
Killer Bee has entered the hospital.

415
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:50,759
We only see two security guards so far.

416
00:23:50,759 --> 00:23:51,880
A man and a woman.

417
00:23:52,319 --> 00:23:52,839
Copy that.

418
00:23:58,160 --> 00:23:59,519
I've actually heard about you for a long time.

419
00:24:00,039 --> 00:24:01,039
I just didn't expect

420
00:24:01,039 --> 00:24:02,400
they'd hire the Silent Protectors this time.

421
00:24:04,599 --> 00:24:07,119
If they can hire Zhong'an, they can hire us too.

422
00:24:07,880 --> 00:24:09,079
I wonder what makes

423
00:24:09,759 --> 00:24:11,000
the Silent Protectors so special.

424
00:24:12,319 --> 00:24:13,079
I think

425
00:24:13,880 --> 00:24:15,880
it just gives clients another option.

426
00:24:16,640 --> 00:24:17,079
Indeed.

427
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:19,440
They really do have another option now.

428
00:24:25,480 --> 00:24:28,119
Mr. Xiang really knows how to plan ahead.

429
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:31,000
He's set up the protection

430
00:24:31,359 --> 00:24:33,039
of Chinese overseas interests in Africa.

431
00:24:33,599 --> 00:24:34,240
And

432
00:24:34,240 --> 00:24:36,319
making it to Antilocaris so quickly.

433
00:24:36,720 --> 00:24:37,480
So,

434
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:38,039
you knew all along

435
00:24:38,039 --> 00:24:39,279
they would turn to Zhong'an.

436
00:24:39,279 --> 00:24:41,839
There was no other choice besides Zhong'an.

437
00:24:42,799 --> 00:24:43,279
Of course.

438
00:24:43,559 --> 00:24:44,440
Only Zhong'an

439
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:45,599
can offer clients

440
00:24:45,599 --> 00:24:47,200
the safest and most comprehensive security.

441
00:24:56,720 --> 00:24:58,480
Why is Helen from Zhong'an here too?

442
00:25:03,240 --> 00:25:04,559
How many times have I told you?

443
00:25:05,079 --> 00:25:07,839
Never lose focus on the job.

444
00:25:09,559 --> 00:25:11,440
Who told them to hire Zhong'an anyway?

445
00:25:13,599 --> 00:25:14,559
Hard to say.

446
00:25:15,519 --> 00:25:16,960
One thing is certain though.

447
00:25:17,759 --> 00:25:18,680
Xavier

448
00:25:18,920 --> 00:25:20,240
definitely doesn't want

449
00:25:20,240 --> 00:25:22,000
too many people to know

450
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:23,240
about his surgery

451
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:24,480
in Antilocaris.

452
00:25:25,359 --> 00:25:26,240
And on that point,

453
00:25:26,759 --> 00:25:28,200
whoever hired Zhong'an

454
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:29,799
is in agreement with him.

455
00:25:30,759 --> 00:25:33,480
Do they have enemies here?

456
00:25:34,599 --> 00:25:35,400
Enemies?

457
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:06,880
It's too quiet.

458
00:26:08,079 --> 00:26:08,839
It really is.

459
00:26:10,799 --> 00:26:12,960
I'll go check outside.

460
00:26:13,160 --> 00:26:14,519
All right. I'll keep watch, go ahead.

461
00:26:17,519 --> 00:26:19,039
Don't let your guard down around anyone.

462
00:26:19,039 --> 00:26:19,839
Don't worry.

463
00:26:19,839 --> 00:26:20,279
Okay.

464
00:27:01,079 --> 00:27:02,480
One of the bodyguards just left.

465
00:27:02,480 --> 00:27:03,640
There's still someone upstairs.

466
00:27:04,359 --> 00:27:05,039
Good.

467
00:27:06,480 --> 00:27:07,720
Proceed as planned.

468
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:45,000
Got any leads?

469
00:27:45,960 --> 00:27:47,079
About Xavier himself?

470
00:27:47,079 --> 00:27:47,880
Nothing yet.

471
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:49,759
But regarding that "W" you mentioned,

472
00:27:49,759 --> 00:27:50,880
there is one likely suspect.

473
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:53,480
Who is it?

474
00:27:55,079 --> 00:27:55,720
Walter.

475
00:27:57,559 --> 00:27:58,319
The general?

476
00:27:59,039 --> 00:28:00,240
I'm not sure it's him,

477
00:28:00,799 --> 00:28:02,799
but the Captain is certain.

478
00:28:03,319 --> 00:28:04,839
Should we have the Captain

479
00:28:05,039 --> 00:28:06,400
reach out to Zhong'an

480
00:28:06,839 --> 00:28:09,640
to ask about the details on Mr. W?

481
00:28:10,240 --> 00:28:10,799
No need.

482
00:28:11,519 --> 00:28:12,680
Odds are,

483
00:28:13,079 --> 00:28:15,920
factions behind the military pressured Zhong'an

484
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:16,920
into taking this case.

485
00:28:18,240 --> 00:28:19,160
Let's talk again once we have leads.

486
00:28:52,279 --> 00:28:52,720
Start.

487
00:29:22,440 --> 00:29:22,920
Scissors.

488
00:29:36,559 --> 00:29:37,799
So Mr. Xavier

489
00:29:37,799 --> 00:29:39,559
always contacted the doctor directly?

490
00:29:40,119 --> 00:29:40,839
Yes.

491
00:29:41,759 --> 00:29:43,240
When did he have his preoperative checkup?

492
00:29:43,559 --> 00:29:44,759
Over two weeks ago.

493
00:29:44,759 --> 00:29:46,960
He came to Antilocaris on business.

494
00:29:46,960 --> 00:29:49,359
He felt heart discomfort right off the plane.

495
00:29:49,640 --> 00:29:51,000
He heard that Dr. Avril

496
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:53,079
is an international cardiovascular expert

497
00:29:53,079 --> 00:29:54,640
visiting here on an exchange program,

498
00:29:54,640 --> 00:29:55,599
so he came.

499
00:29:57,279 --> 00:29:58,799
Who are you? You can't just—

500
00:30:05,799 --> 00:30:07,640
We're Mr. Xavier's friends.

501
00:30:08,599 --> 00:30:09,720
We came specially to visit him.

502
00:30:10,559 --> 00:30:13,559
Excuse me, where is he now?

503
00:30:21,279 --> 00:30:21,920
Miss,

504
00:30:22,599 --> 00:30:24,200
if you die right here,

505
00:30:24,920 --> 00:30:26,200
I bet Mr. Xavier

506
00:30:26,200 --> 00:30:27,640
won't even know your name.

507
00:30:28,200 --> 00:30:29,440
The only ones truly heartbroken

508
00:30:29,880 --> 00:30:32,119
will be your family and friends.

509
00:30:32,559 --> 00:30:33,559
Why would you

510
00:30:33,759 --> 00:30:36,960
bring pain to the people who love you?

511
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:40,400
Talk. Are you a doctor?

512
00:30:40,759 --> 00:30:43,680
No, I'm the head nurse.

513
00:30:44,319 --> 00:30:45,960
He's still in surgery right now.

514
00:30:46,799 --> 00:30:47,960
A male head nurse?

515
00:30:52,599 --> 00:30:54,799
Yes, he's our head nurse, Derek.

516
00:30:57,720 --> 00:30:59,039
I don't care who you are.

517
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:01,960
How much longer will this surgery take?

518
00:31:03,799 --> 00:31:05,880
About two to three more hours.

519
00:31:08,200 --> 00:31:09,200
It depends on how it goes.

520
00:31:09,640 --> 00:31:11,160
At least two and a half hours.

521
00:31:23,359 --> 00:31:26,400
It matches our intel.

522
00:31:27,400 --> 00:31:30,000
The surgery can proceed as planned.

523
00:31:30,839 --> 00:31:32,559
But if anything unusual happens,

524
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:33,799
take over the operating room.

525
00:31:34,039 --> 00:31:34,440
Copy that.

526
00:32:12,039 --> 00:32:13,279
For a girl,

527
00:32:14,359 --> 00:32:15,920
you're pretty skilled.

528
00:32:16,759 --> 00:32:17,400
Who are you?

529
00:32:17,680 --> 00:32:19,519
You talk too much.

530
00:32:24,640 --> 00:32:25,640
I don't want to hurt anyone.

531
00:32:27,039 --> 00:32:29,039
If you cooperate right now,

532
00:32:29,240 --> 00:32:31,000
you might still have a one percent chance

533
00:32:31,000 --> 00:32:31,640
of beating me,

534
00:32:32,599 --> 00:32:34,279
or stopping me from taking him

535
00:32:34,640 --> 00:32:35,960
after the surgery is done.

536
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:39,920
But if you refuse to be sensible,

537
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:45,079
that chance will definitely be zero.

538
00:32:47,119 --> 00:32:49,920
The perimeter of Rossi Hospital is clear now.

539
00:32:50,359 --> 00:32:52,200
Pull your team back and monitor the military.

540
00:32:52,559 --> 00:32:54,279
Understood. I'm on it.

541
00:32:54,279 --> 00:32:56,200
Good. Stay in touch at all times.

542
00:33:14,440 --> 00:33:16,240
Any problems on your end?

543
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:17,200
Nothing for now.

544
00:33:18,319 --> 00:33:19,200
You're outside?

545
00:33:19,240 --> 00:33:20,160
Yeah. Sha Lan,

546
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:24,160
run a license plate for me: AC37643.

547
00:34:11,360 --> 00:34:12,480
Take this one away.

548
00:34:13,719 --> 00:34:15,400
I need someone who can speak properly.

549
00:34:17,239 --> 00:34:18,719
Can't you understand what he's saying?

550
00:34:21,159 --> 00:34:22,559
Let me translate it for you.

551
00:34:22,920 --> 00:34:25,199
He says you're completely useless to us.

552
00:34:25,920 --> 00:34:26,960
As a useless person,

553
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:28,760
if you refuse to cooperate...

554
00:34:29,360 --> 00:34:30,840
why should we keep you around?

555
00:34:33,079 --> 00:34:33,599
Wait.

556
00:34:35,960 --> 00:34:37,559
The person in the operating room—

557
00:34:37,840 --> 00:34:39,239
where are his belongings?

558
00:34:41,719 --> 00:34:42,480
In the lockers.

559
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:46,559
I... I can take you there.

560
00:34:46,800 --> 00:34:47,599
Where's the key?

561
00:34:49,280 --> 00:34:50,360
Give them the key, hurry!

562
00:34:50,840 --> 00:34:52,159
It's in the right pocket.

563
00:35:00,320 --> 00:35:02,000
Take her down to the lobby.

564
00:35:02,480 --> 00:35:02,840
Move.

565
00:35:10,159 --> 00:35:11,039
This is the room.

566
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:35,400
Get ready to move.

567
00:36:43,280 --> 00:36:44,159
Can this

568
00:36:44,679 --> 00:36:46,679
be heard throughout the hospital?

569
00:36:50,679 --> 00:36:51,760
What about the operating room?

570
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:55,880
At a time like this,

571
00:36:56,480 --> 00:36:58,639
don't even think about playing tricks.

572
00:37:00,360 --> 00:37:01,719
The operating room is soundproof.

573
00:37:02,480 --> 00:37:04,119
Then how do you contact the operating room?

574
00:37:04,119 --> 00:37:05,440
That phone on the wall.

575
00:37:06,480 --> 00:37:07,840
Once the surgery is finished,

576
00:37:08,119 --> 00:37:09,679
they'll use that phone to contact us.

577
00:37:39,639 --> 00:37:40,400
Attention, everyone.

578
00:37:41,679 --> 00:37:42,840
What happens next...

579
00:37:43,119 --> 00:37:45,679
is a highly unlikely event.

580
00:37:46,599 --> 00:37:50,320
I have taken over this hospital by force.

581
00:37:53,920 --> 00:37:55,440
At all key locations,

582
00:37:55,719 --> 00:37:57,719
I've already planted bombs.

583
00:37:58,639 --> 00:38:00,239
Don't panic.

584
00:38:00,599 --> 00:38:03,280
I expect you to follow my orders.

585
00:38:03,920 --> 00:38:05,480
Do not do anything

586
00:38:05,480 --> 00:38:07,280
to interfere with my work.

587
00:38:07,880 --> 00:38:09,199
Attention, everyone.

588
00:38:10,079 --> 00:38:12,360
Move quickly to the first-floor lobby.

589
00:38:13,199 --> 00:38:14,840
That includes all inpatients.

590
00:38:15,519 --> 00:38:16,000
Of course,

591
00:38:16,639 --> 00:38:17,880
post-op patients

592
00:38:17,880 --> 00:38:19,719
and those in the ICU

593
00:38:19,719 --> 00:38:20,760
can be an exception.

594
00:38:22,320 --> 00:38:23,320
I repeat:

595
00:38:23,840 --> 00:38:26,039
move quickly to the first-floor lobby.

596
00:38:27,159 --> 00:38:29,159
I expect your full cooperation.

597
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:32,079
If there is any resistance,

598
00:38:32,880 --> 00:38:35,360
I won't hesitate to use lethal force.

599
00:38:42,159 --> 00:38:42,800
Get out!

600
00:38:43,519 --> 00:38:44,159
Hurry up!

601
00:38:44,519 --> 00:38:46,280
To the lobby, everyone! Move!

602
00:38:48,599 --> 00:38:49,159
Move!

603
00:38:50,880 --> 00:38:51,719
Everyone out!

604
00:38:55,760 --> 00:38:56,840
Listen up, team.

605
00:38:57,800 --> 00:38:59,239
Check the bathrooms thoroughly,

606
00:38:59,880 --> 00:39:02,280
under the beds and desks.

607
00:39:02,760 --> 00:39:05,079
See if anyone is hiding.

608
00:39:05,519 --> 00:39:07,800
If you find anyone, take them out immediately.

609
00:39:08,159 --> 00:39:09,000
Show no mercy.

610
00:39:32,119 --> 00:39:33,920
Floors one and two are secure.

611
00:39:34,639 --> 00:39:36,440
Floors three and four are secure.

612
00:39:40,440 --> 00:39:43,239
Copy. Go check this floor.

613
00:39:43,639 --> 00:39:44,159
Roger.

614
00:39:55,519 --> 00:39:57,280
Attention, everyone in the lobby!

615
00:39:57,880 --> 00:39:58,360
Get down!

616
00:39:59,079 --> 00:40:00,639
Hurry up, don't drag your feet!

617
00:40:01,639 --> 00:40:01,920
Hurry!

618
00:40:01,920 --> 00:40:02,599
Please, everyone,

619
00:40:02,920 --> 00:40:03,239
get down!

620
00:40:03,480 --> 00:40:06,119
Hand over all your communication devices!

621
00:40:06,559 --> 00:40:08,280
Don't get any funny ideas.

622
00:40:08,880 --> 00:40:11,239
If anyone dares to hide one,

623
00:40:11,800 --> 00:40:12,599
and I find out,

624
00:40:12,599 --> 00:40:14,320
Put your phone in this bag,

625
00:40:14,960 --> 00:40:16,400
then pass it to the person next to you.

626
00:40:16,800 --> 00:40:18,000
the person next to them

627
00:40:18,480 --> 00:40:20,440
will get the exact same punishment!

628
00:40:21,679 --> 00:40:22,400
Keep your heads down!

629
00:40:32,400 --> 00:40:33,159
This is Hyena.

630
00:40:33,159 --> 00:40:34,480
Are you still on this floor?

631
00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:35,039
Yes.

632
00:40:35,519 --> 00:40:36,480
Come back to my position.

633
00:40:36,760 --> 00:40:37,800
Understood. Copy that.

634
00:40:45,639 --> 00:40:46,960
Take the people Xavier hired

635
00:40:46,960 --> 00:40:48,280
down to the first-floor lobby.

636
00:40:49,320 --> 00:40:50,480
Including this male nurse.

637
00:40:57,800 --> 00:40:58,800
Stop calling. Stop calling.

638
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:02,440
Both phones are ringing through,

639
00:41:02,440 --> 00:41:03,679
but neither of them is picking up!

640
00:41:05,559 --> 00:41:08,159
Maybe they don't have their phones on them.

641
00:41:09,880 --> 00:41:10,800
Then what do we do?

642
00:41:12,280 --> 00:41:13,880
Stay here. Don't move.

643
00:41:14,559 --> 00:41:15,840
I'll go check out the hospital.

644
00:41:24,280 --> 00:41:25,639
Cover it with cloth!

645
00:41:26,760 --> 00:41:28,440
Over there! Here, over here!

646
00:41:29,519 --> 00:41:30,320
Cover everything up!

647
00:41:31,079 --> 00:41:32,239
Don't leave a single gap!

648
00:41:33,000 --> 00:41:34,840
Seems they just want to control the hospital.

649
00:41:35,199 --> 00:41:37,679
I have to find a way to contact the outside.

650
00:41:49,239 --> 00:41:49,880
Freeze!

651
00:41:51,599 --> 00:41:52,119
Open it.

652
00:41:55,559 --> 00:41:56,159
Hurry up!

653
00:42:01,599 --> 00:42:02,440
Give me the keys.

654
00:42:03,800 --> 00:42:04,519
You, come here.

655
00:42:47,239 --> 00:42:49,000
Xavier's surgery is still underway.

656
00:42:49,599 --> 00:42:50,840
There are two people on the fifth floor.

657
00:42:51,480 --> 00:42:52,599
Nothing else is confirmed yet.

658
00:42:53,280 --> 00:42:54,039
Be quiet.

659
00:43:00,840 --> 00:43:02,079
It's time for me

660
00:43:02,639 --> 00:43:04,639
to contact General Walter.

661
00:43:12,000 --> 00:43:12,639
Hello,

662
00:43:13,280 --> 00:43:14,159
General Walter.

663
00:43:14,719 --> 00:43:16,880
This is Antilocaris Hospital.

664
00:43:17,400 --> 00:43:20,639
I'm the one behind this hostage situation.

665
00:43:21,960 --> 00:43:24,199
I advise you not to harm anyone in the hospital.

666
00:43:26,519 --> 00:43:27,400
Xavier's

667
00:43:28,559 --> 00:43:30,639
best friend in the Kingdom of Supedo...

668
00:43:30,639 --> 00:43:31,679
That would be you, right?

669
00:43:32,519 --> 00:43:33,199
I don't want to do anything

670
00:43:33,199 --> 00:43:35,119
to anyone else in the hospital.
